{"articleNo":"123474","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=123474&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"졸업유예자 졸업예정증명서 발급에 관하여","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.02.17","hit":"5482","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2015년도 졸업유예를 신청하여 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>오는&nbsp;8월에 졸업하는 학생의</strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">\"졸업예정증명서\" 발급은 수기로 발급</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>되오니 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>착오없으시기 바랍니다</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>자동증명기 등 정식으로 발행되는 시기는</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>수업일수 1/4선(2015.3.27)</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>이후 입니다</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2015.2.17&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>금오공과대학교학사서비스센터</strong></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
